  "body": "## Pulse Music v3.2.3 - BiniLyrics API Integration & Real-Time Audio Output Badge\r\n\r\n### \ud83c\udfb5 BiniLyrics API Integration (lrc.red)\r\n- **High-Accuracy Word & Line Synced Lyrics**: Integrated `https://lyrics-api.binimum.org/` with `.ttml` (word-by-word) and `.lrc` (line-by-line) streaming directly from `https://lrc.red/`.\r\n- **Automatic Fallback Chain**: Redundant failover between LRCLIB and BiniLyrics ensuring 100% lyrics coverage for rare songs and international releases.\r\n- **Settings Switcher**: Select between LRCLIB and BiniLyrics in Settings > Lyrics Provider or the quick bottom sheet.\r\n\r\n### \ud83c\udfa7 Real-Time Audio Output Priority Resolver (All 4 Players)\r\n- **Instant Hardware Priority**: Resolves Bluetooth device model (`productName`, e.g. *Sony WH-1000XM4*, *Galaxy Buds2 Pro*) > Wired/USB Headphones > Phone Speaker.\r\n- **Dynamic Re-evaluation**: Updates instantaneously whenever Bluetooth or wired headphones are plugged or unplugged.\r\n- **Soft Pastel Badging**: Lavender and periwinkle badges with zero neon green or harsh white across BitChord, Spotify, Apple Music, and M3 Expressive players.\r\n\r\n### \u26a1 Player & Performance Polish\r\n- **Material 3 Expressive Progress Bar**: Fluid seek bar with smooth scrubbing.\r\n- **Glassmorphic Fullscreen Lyrics**: Multi-layered Gaussian blur backdrop.\r\n- **Windows Updater**: Dynamic asset lookup preventing 404 setup download errors.\r\n"
